        ["The strip at the top of the screen: the current step, clearly shown with its distance, the other tasks, nearby quests to pick up and the places chosen below. Click a point: the guide points at it. Drag it to move it, Ctrl + mouse wheel for its size, pull its ends for its width."] = "屏幕顶部的横条：醒目显示当前步骤及其距离、其他任务、附近可接的任务以及下方选择的地点。点击一个点：指南就指向它。拖动即可移动，Ctrl + 鼠标滚轮调整大小，拖动两端调整宽度。",
        ["The sword buttons put a skull on the mob they targeted, to spot it."] = "剑按钮会在其选中的怪物上标记骷髅以便辨认。",
        ["The walking path planned by the guide, around cliffs and water: a green mark on the compass shows the way to go, orange when you stray from it. Automatic: except when Shortest Path Forever guides you."] = "指南规划的步行路线，绕开悬崖和水域：指南针上的绿色标记显示该走的方向，偏离时变为橙色。自动：Shortest Path Forever 为你导航时除外。",
        ["The way on foot is found in game from where you stand: around steep ground, over bridges, through caves and lifts, and found again when you leave it. Unchecked: the walk the guide planned from the previous step."] = "在游戏中从你所在的位置寻找步行路线：绕开陡峭地形，经过桥梁、洞穴和升降梯，偏离时重新寻找。取消勾选：使用指南从上一步规划的路线。",
        ["The window with the current step and the next ones."] = "显示当前及后续步骤的窗口。",
        ["Those of the professions learned or planned by the guide."] = "已学或指南计划学习的专业的训练师。",
        ["Those the guide counts for the character's power; buy the others yourself."] = "指南计入角色战力的法术；其他的请自行购买。",
        ["Those the guide still takes: not those it abandons, marks done or leaves behind. You can still take them by hand."] = "仅限指南仍会接取的任务：不包括它放弃的、标记为完成或已跳过的任务。你仍可手动接取。",
